  "body": "**Link to problem area**: https://spec.matrix.org/latest/client-server-api/#client-behaviour-4\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\n\r\nThe second half of the example is meant to be indented like the first half, this renders OK when just looking at [the markdown file](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/blob/72ff5b92cbef143f976291789294ff98bc142711/content/client-server-api/modules/receipts.md#client-behaviour), but seems borked when view on spec.matrix.org.\r\n\r\nThe sentence at the bottom is also rendered oddly:\r\n\r\n# spec.matrix.org screenshot\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/517124/145239373-d91bf62f-93be-47c7-9459-d0c56369e986.png)\r\n\r\n# GitHub rendered:\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/517124/145239512-b9273ebd-1b77-4177-9887-e57175562104.png)\r\n\r\n",
